  "tip": "<p>When latency rises but CPU and memory are steady, think <i>query plan</i> and <i>indexes</i> rather than more hardware. Start with the <i>slow query log</i>, use <i>EXPLAIN</i> to confirm access paths, and design <i>selective composite indexes</i> for the filters and joins that matter most.</p>",
